OL,3,A'Glam, funny, kind': World remembers
OL,4,ADolly Parton as star dies from cancer
OL,5,Aaged 80
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Dolly was glam, funny, and kind," says
OL,8,FKaty Perry, as tributes pour in from
OL,9,Faround the world to Dolly Parton, who
OL,10,Fhas died aged 80
OL,12,FThe country star died on Tuesday after
OL,13,Fa "brief battle with cancer", her
OL,14,Fmanagement team says
OL,16,FA world without Parton "doesn't feel
OL,17,Fpossible, real, or right", says Taylor
OL,18,FSwift, while Sir Paul McCartney calls
OL,19,Fher a "bubbly" character whose singing
OL,20,Fand songwriting were "unrivalled in the
OL,21,Fworld of country music"
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
